# shadcn/ui

The only `components.json` is `packages/ui/components.json`. Never add one under `apps/`.

- Add components: `bun run ui:add -- button` (Turbo task on `@repo/ui`).
- Do not run `shadcn init` or `shadcn add` from an app.
- Apps import `@repo/ui/components/<name>`, `@repo/ui/lib/utils`, `@repo/ui/hooks/<name>`.
- Inside `@repo/ui`, use `#components/*`, `#lib/*`, `#hooks/*`.
